{%- comment -%}
  GTA Print Lab — Customizer v2 (Printeez-style design workspace)
  Data contract: docs/customizer-data-model.md
  Requires product options: Color / Size / # of Print Areas
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- assign s = section.settings -%}

{%- comment -%} gpl-customizer.js must load BEFORE Alpine — Alpine starts on execute and needs gplQuickOrder defined {%- endcomment -%}
<script src="{{ 'gpl-fabric.min.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
<script src="{{ 'gpl-customizer-v2-editor.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
<script src="{{ 'gpl-customizer-v2.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
<script src="{{ 'gpl-alpine.min.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
{%- comment -%} Editor fonts (Google Fonts, open licences suitable for print) {%- endcomment -%}
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Anton&family=Archivo+Black&family=Bangers&family=Bebas+Neue&family=Black+Ops+One&family=Dancing+Script:wght@700&family=Inter:wght@400;700&family=Lobster&family=Merriweather:ital,wght@0,400;0,700;1,400;1,700&family=Montserrat:ital,wght@0,400;0,700;0,800;1,400;1,700&family=Open+Sans:ital,wght@0,400;0,700;1,400;1,700&family=Oswald:wght@400;700&family=Pacifico&family=Permanent+Marker&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,700;1,400;1,700&family=Roboto+Condensed:ital,wght@0,400;0,700;1,400;1,700&family=Russo+One&family=Teko:wght@700&display=swap">

{%- capture variants_json -%}
[{%- for v in product.variants -%}
{"id":{{ v.id }},"color":{{ v.option1 | json }},"size":{{ v.option2 | json }},"tier":{{ v.option3 | json }},"price":{{ v.price }},"available":{{ v.available }},"image":{% if v.featured_image %}{{ v.featured_image | image_url: width: 900 | json }}{% else %}null{% endif %}}{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}
{%- endfor -%}]
{%- endcapture -%}

{%- capture mockups_json -%}
{ {%- assign first = true -%}
{%- for img in product.images -%}
  {%- assign alt = img.alt | default: '' -%}
  {%- if alt contains 'mockup:' -%}
    {%- assign parts = alt | remove: 'mockup:' | split: ':' -%}
    {%- if parts.size >= 2 -%}
      {%- unless first %},{% endunless %}{%- assign first = false -%}
      {{ parts[0] | strip | append: '|' | append: parts[1] | json }}:{{ img | image_url: width: 1100 | json }}
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%} }
{%- endcapture -%}

{%- assign areas_meta = product.metafields.custom.print_areas.value -%}
{%- comment -%}
  v2: a section-level JSON override sits between the product metafield and the
  hard-coded fallbacks, so print zones can be calibrated from the theme editor
  (and per-template pilots can ship zones) without Admin API access. Same shape
  as the metafield's areas ARRAY: [{"name":"Front","zone":{"x":..,"y":..,"w":..,"h":..},
  "w_in":12,"h_in":16}, ...]. The optional w_in/h_in are the zone's physical
  print size in inches — needed later to render print files at 300 DPI.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign areas_override_raw = '' -%}
{%- if s.print_areas_json != blank -%}
  {%- assign areas_override_raw = s.print_areas_json | strip -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- comment -%}
  Precedence: product metafield wins over the section override, unless
  "Override product metafield zones" is ticked — used while calibrating a product
  from the theme editor, or for a pilot template before the metafield is updated.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign use_override = false -%}
{%- if areas_override_raw != blank -%}
  {%- if s.print_areas_force or areas_meta == blank -%}
    {%- assign use_override = true -%}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}

{%- comment -%}
  Sleeveless garments (tank tops) can't take a sleeve print — the generic 4-zone
  fallback below (Front/Back/Left Side/Right Side) assumes sleeves exist, which is
  wrong for anything sleeveless. No per-product print_areas metafield exists yet for
  any product on this theme, so every customizer product hits this same fallback;
  this is the one case where offering a zone is a physical impossibility rather than
  a business choice, so it's safe to special-case here rather than requiring a
  metafield for every single product.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign is_sleeveless = false -%}
{%- if product.title contains 'Tank' or product.title contains 'Racerback' or product.title contains 'Sleeveless' -%}
  {%- assign is_sleeveless = true -%}
{%- endif -%}

{%- comment -%}
  Headwear has no torso/sleeves at all — it gets its own Front + Side zone pair
  (the standard embroidery/print placements on a cap) instead of the shirt fallback,
  and its own icon shapes (see artShape() in gpl-customizer.js).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign is_headwear = false -%}
{%- if product.type == 'Headwear' -%}
  {%- assign is_headwear = true -%}
{%- endif -%}

{%- comment -%}
  Flat accessories (aprons/blankets/towels/bibs) have one printable face and no
  torso/sleeves either — Front only. A real garment among the Accessories type
  (e.g. the chef coat, which has sleeves and Front/Back/Side photos) is deliberately
  NOT matched here and falls through to the standard shirt zones below, which fit it.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign is_flat_accessory = false -%}
{%- if product.title contains 'Apron' or product.title contains 'Blanket' or product.title contains 'Towel' or product.title contains 'Bib' -%}
  {%- assign is_flat_accessory = true -%}
{%- endif -%}

{%- comment -%}
  First-paint fallback for the mockup image, before Alpine boots and currentMockup()
  takes over. Prefer a Front-tagged product photo (a clean per-colour shot) over
  product.featured_image, which on this catalogue is often an untagged lifestyle
  photo with placeholder art baked into the pixels.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign default_mockup = product.featured_image -%}
{%- for pimg in product.images -%}
  {%- if pimg.alt == 'Front' or pimg.alt contains ':Front' -%}
    {%- assign default_mockup = pimg -%}
    {%- break -%}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}

{%- capture gpl_cz_json -%}
{
  "productId": {{ product.id }},
  "variants": {{ variants_json | strip }},
  "sizes": {{ product.options_with_values[1].values | json }},
  {%- comment -%}
    Liquid exposes at most 250 variants. Only advertise colours we actually have
    variant data for, so a swatch can never lead to a dead size grid.
    storefrontToken (optional) lets the JS hydrate the full catalogue.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  "colors": [
    {%- assign seen = '' -%}
    {%- assign emitted = 0 -%}
    {%- for v in product.variants -%}
      {%- assign key = '|' | append: v.option1 | append: '|' -%}
      {%- unless seen contains key -%}
        {%- assign seen = seen | append: key -%}
        {%- if emitted > 0 %},{% endif %}{"name": {{ v.option1 | json }}, "hex": "", "image": null}
        {%- assign emitted = emitted | plus: 1 -%}
      {%- endunless -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  ],
  "allColorNames": {{ product.options_with_values[0].values | json }},
  {%- comment -%} full catalogue for products above Liquid's 250-variant cap {%- endcomment -%}
  "variantMap": {% if product.metafields.custom.variant_map %}{{ product.metafields.custom.variant_map.value | json }}{% else %}null{% endif %},
  "storefrontToken": {{ s.storefront_token | default: '' | json }},
  "productHandle": {{ product.handle | json }},
  "areas": {% if use_override %}{{ areas_override_raw }}{% elsif areas_meta %}{{ areas_meta.areas | json }}{% elsif is_headwear %}[{"name":"Front","zone":{"x":0.32,"y":0.3,"w":0.36,"h":0.16}},{"name":"Side","zone":{"x":0.34,"y":0.34,"w":0.22,"h":0.14}}]{% elsif is_flat_accessory %}[{"name":"Front","zone":{"x":0.28,"y":0.28,"w":0.44,"h":0.4}}]{% elsif is_sleeveless %}[{"name":"Front","zone":{"x":0.3,"y":0.24,"w":0.4,"h":0.46}},{"name":"Back","zone":{"x":0.3,"y":0.2,"w":0.4,"h":0.5}},{"name":"Inside Label","zone":{"x":0.35,"y":0.3,"w":0.3,"h":0.3},"w_in":3,"h_in":3,"view":"inside_label"}]{% else %}[{"name":"Front","zone":{"x":0.3,"y":0.24,"w":0.4,"h":0.46}},{"name":"Back","zone":{"x":0.3,"y":0.2,"w":0.4,"h":0.5}},{"name":"Left Side","zone":{"x":0.38,"y":0.3,"w":0.24,"h":0.2}},{"name":"Right Side","zone":{"x":0.38,"y":0.3,"w":0.24,"h":0.2}},{"name":"Inside Label","zone":{"x":0.35,"y":0.3,"w":0.3,"h":0.3},"w_in":3,"h_in":3,"view":"inside_label"}]{% endif %},
  "areasSource": "{% if use_override %}override{% elsif areas_meta %}metafield{% else %}fallback{% endif %}",
  "isHeadwear": {{ is_headwear }},
  "isFlatAccessory": {{ is_flat_accessory }},
  "mockups": {{ mockups_json | strip }},
  "images": [{%- for img in product.images -%}{"src": {{ img | image_url: width: 1100 | json }}, "alt": {{ img.alt | default: '' | json }}}{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}{%- endfor -%}],
  "fallbackImage": {{ default_mockup | image_url: width: 1100 | json }},
  "uploadKey": {{ s.upload_public_key | json }},
  "cdnBase": {{ s.upload_cdn_base | default: 'ucarecdn.com' | json }},
  "shipMinDays": {{ s.ship_min_days | default: 8 }},
  "shipMaxDays": {{ s.ship_max_days | default: 14 }},
  "methods": [
    {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
      {"name": {{ block.settings.name | json }}, "description": {{ block.settings.description | json }}, "image": {% if block.settings.image %}{{ block.settings.image | image_url: width: 300 | json }}{% else %}null{% endif %}}{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}
    {%- endfor -%}
  ]
}
{%- endcapture -%}
{%- comment -%}
  This payload can be tens of KB for a full colour/size matrix. It used to be inlined
  directly as the x-data attribute value; a single-quoted HTML attribute breaks on the
  first literal apostrophe inside it (e.g. any "Men's"/"Women's" in a title, description,
  or image alt text), which the parser reads as the attribute's closing quote — silently
  truncating the JSON mid-string and leaving Alpine unable to parse x-data at all. A
  <script type="application/json"> element has no quoting conflict with its own content.
{%- endcomment -%}
<script type="application/json" id="gpl-cz-data-{{ section.id }}">{{ gpl_cz_json | strip }}</script>

<section
  id="gpl-cz-{{ section.id }}"
  class="gpl-cz gpl-cz--ws"
  x-data="gplQuickOrderV2('{{ section.id }}')"
  :class="{'is-editing': sel.has, 'panel-edit': panel === 'edit', 'sheet-open': sheet}"
>
  <div class="gpl-cz__ws">
    {%- comment -%} ============ CANVAS ============ {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="gpl-cz__canvas">
      <div class="gpl-cz__viewport" data-gpl-viewport :style="'--zoom:' + zoom">
        <div class="gpl-cz__stage" data-gpl-stage>
          <img class="gpl-cz__mockup" src="{{ default_mockup | image_url: width: 1100 }}" :src="currentMockup()" width="{{ default_mockup.width | default: 764 }}" height="{{ default_mockup.height | default: 861 }}" alt="{{ product.title | escape }}" loading="eager">
          <template x-for="area in areas" :key="area.name">
            <div
              class="gpl-cz__zone"
              x-show="activePrintArea === area.name"
              :style="`left:${area.zone.x*100}%;top:${area.zone.y*100}%;width:${area.zone.w*100}%;height:${area.zone.h*100}%`"
            >
              <span class="gpl-cz__zone-label">Print area <b x-text="zoneLabel(area.name)"></b></span>
              <template x-if="!designHasObjects(activeColor, area.name)">
                <div class="gpl-cz__zone-cta gpl-cz__zone-cta--v2">
                  <label class="gpl-cz__zone-btn">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 16V4M7 9l5-5 5 5"/><path d="M4 20h16"/></svg>
                    <span>Upload artwork</span>
                    <input type="file" accept=".png,.jpg,.jpeg,.svg,.webp,.pdf,.heic,.tif,.tiff,.eps,.ai" hidden
                      @change="uploadArtwork(activeColor, area.name, $event.target.files[0]); $event.target.value=''">
                  </label>
                  <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__zone-btn" @click="addText()">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 7V4h14v3M9 20h6M12 4v16"/></svg>
                    <span>Add text</span>
                  </button>
                  <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__zone-btn" @click="addNumber()">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 9h16M4 15h16M10 3 8 21M16 3l-2 18"/></svg>
                    <span>Add number</span>
                  </button>
                  <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__zone-btn" x-show="library.length" @click="panel = 'files'">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 20V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4l2 2h6a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2Z"/></svg>
                    <span>From library</span>
                  </button>
                </div>
              </template>
            </div>
          </template>
          {%- comment -%} Canvas stays interactive whenever the area has objects; when it's
               empty, clicks fall through to the zone's Upload/Add buttons underneath. {%- endcomment -%}
          <div class="gpl-cz__fwrap" :style="designHasObjects(activeColor, activePrintArea) ? '' : 'pointer-events:none'">
            <canvas x-ref="fcanvas"></canvas>
          </div>
          <span class="gpl-cz__chip" x-show="chip.show" x-cloak :style="`left:${chip.x}px;top:${chip.y + 10}px`" x-text="chip.text"></span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="gpl-cz__zoombar">
        <span class="gpl-cz__stage-hint"><strong x-text="(previewColorName || activeColor)"></strong> · <span x-text="activePrintArea"></span></span>
        <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__ico" title="Zoom out" @click="zoomOut()" :disabled="zoom <= 1"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M5 12h14"/></svg></button>
        <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__zoomval" title="Reset zoom" @click="zoomReset()" x-text="Math.round(zoom * 100) + '%'"></button>
        <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__ico" title="Zoom in" @click="zoomIn()" :disabled="zoom >= 3"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></button>
      </div>
      <div class="gpl-cz__views">
        <template x-for="area in areas" :key="area.name">
          <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__view" :class="{'is-active': activePrintArea === area.name}" @click="setArea(area.name)">
            <span class="gpl-cz__view-thumb">
              <img :src="viewImage(activeColor, area.name)" width="76" height="76" alt="" loading="lazy">
              <span class="gpl-cz__view-check" x-show="designHasObjects(activeColor, area.name)" x-cloak>
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m5 12 5 5L20 7"/></svg>
              </span>
            </span>
            <span class="gpl-cz__view-label" x-text="area.name"></span>
          </button>
        </template>
      </div>
    </div>

   <div class="gpl-cz__dock">
    {%- comment -%} ============ RAIL ============ {%- endcomment -%}
    <nav class="gpl-cz__rail" aria-label="Designer tools">
      <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__rail-btn" :class="{'is-active': panel === 'product'}" @click="openPanel('product')">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M8 3 3 6l2 4 2-1v11h10V9l2 1 2-4-5-3a3 3 0 0 1-8 0Z"/></svg>
        <span>Product</span>
      </button>
      <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__rail-btn" :class="{'is-active': panel === 'layers'}" @click="openPanel('layers')">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m12 3 9 5-9 5-9-5 9-5Z"/><path d="m3 12 9 5 9-5"/><path d="m3 16 9 5 9-5"/></svg>
        <span>Layers</span>
        <em class="gpl-cz__rail-badge" x-show="objectsInArea().length" x-text="objectsInArea().length" x-cloak></em>
      </button>
      <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__rail-btn" :class="{'is-active': panel === 'files'}" @click="openPanel('files')">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 20V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4l2 2h6a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2Z"/><path d="M12 10v6M9 13l3-3 3 3"/></svg>
        <span>Files</span>
      </button>
      <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__rail-btn" :class="{'is-active': panel === 'text'}" @click="openPanel('text')">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 7V4h14v3M9 20h6M12 4v16"/></svg>
        <span>Text</span>
      </button>
      <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__rail-btn gpl-cz__rail-btn--edit" :class="{'is-active': panel === 'edit'}" @click="openPanel('edit')" x-show="sel.has" x-cloak>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 20h4l10-10-4-4L4 16v4Z"/><path d="m12 8 4 4"/></svg>
        <span>Edit</span>
      </button>
    </nav>

    {%- comment -%} ============ PANEL ============ {%- endcomment -%}
    <aside class="gpl-cz__panel">
      <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__sheet-close" @click="sheet = false" aria-label="Close panel"><span></span></button>
      {%- comment -%} ---- Product ---- {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="gpl-cz__pane" x-show="panel === 'product'">
        {%- assign title_parts = product.title | split: '|' -%}
        <div class="gpl-cz__product">
          <img class="gpl-cz__product-thumb" src="{{ default_mockup | image_url: width: 160 }}" width="56" height="56" alt="">
          <div class="gpl-cz__product-copy">
            {%- if title_parts.size > 1 -%}
              <h1 class="gpl-cz__title">{{ title_parts[1] | strip }}</h1>
              <p class="gpl-cz__subtitle">{{ title_parts[0] | strip }}</p>
            {%- else -%}
              <h1 class="gpl-cz__title">{{ product.title }}</h1>
            {%- endif -%}
            <p class="gpl-cz__subtitle"><span x-text="openColors.length + (openColors.length === 1 ? ' colour' : ' colours')"></span> · <span x-text="areas.length + ' print areas'"></span></p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <template x-for="colorName in openColors" :key="colorName">
          <div class="gpl-cz__card" :class="{'is-active': activeColor === colorName}">
            <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__card-head" title="Show this colour on the stage"
              @click="activeColor = colorName; previewColorName = null; syncVariantUrl()">
              <span class="gpl-cz__grid-thumb" :style="swatchStyle(colorName)"></span>
              <strong x-text="colorName"></strong>
              <em x-text="unitsFor(colorName) ? unitsFor(colorName) + ' pcs' : ''"></em>
              <span class="gpl-cz__card-remove" title="Remove colour" @click.stop="removeColor(colorName)">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18"/></svg>
              </span>
            </button>
            <div class="gpl-cz__sizes" x-show="!isTeam(colorName)">
              <template x-for="size in sizes" :key="size">
                <div class="gpl-cz__size">
                  <span class="gpl-cz__size-label" x-text="size"></span>
                  <template x-if="availableFor(colorName, size)">
                    <input type="number" min="0" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="0"
                      :value="qty[key(colorName,size)] || ''"
                      @input="setQty(colorName, size, $event.target.value)">
                  </template>
                  <template x-if="!availableFor(colorName, size)">
                    <span class="gpl-cz__oos">Sold out</span>
                  </template>
                  <span class="gpl-cz__size-price" x-text="money(priceFor(colorName, size))"></span>
                </div>
              </template>
            </div>
            <label class="gpl-cz__toggle">
              <input type="checkbox" :checked="isTeam(colorName)" @change="setTeam(colorName, $event.target.checked)">
              <span class="gpl-cz__toggle-track"></span>
              <span>Team order <em>names &amp; numbers, one shirt per player</em></span>
            </label>
            <div class="gpl-cz__roster" x-show="isTeam(colorName)" x-cloak>
              <p class="gpl-cz__fine" x-show="!areas.some(a => areaHasRoles(colorName, a.name))">Tip: use <b>Text → Name + number</b> to add player fields to the design, or bind any text layer with “Team field”. Each player's name and number is printed on their shirt.</p>
              <div class="gpl-cz__roster-head"><span>Player</span><span>#</span><span>Size</span><span>Qty</span><span></span></div>
              <template x-for="row in rosterFor(colorName)" :key="row.id">
                <div class="gpl-cz__roster-row">
                  <input type="text" maxlength="20" placeholder="Name" :value="row.name" @input="setRow(colorName, row.id, 'name', $event.target.value)">
                  <input type="text" inputmode="numeric" maxlength="3" placeholder="00" :value="row.number" @input="setRow(colorName, row.id, 'number', $event.target.value)">
                  <select x-effect="const v = row.size; $nextTick(() => { $el.value = v })" :class="{'is-empty': !row.size}" @change="setRow(colorName, row.id, 'size', $event.target.value)">
                    <option value="">Size</option>
                    <template x-for="size in sizes" :key="size">
                      <option :value="size" x-text="size" :disabled="!availableFor(colorName, size)"></option>
                    </template>
                  </select>
                  <input type="number" min="1" :value="row.qty" @input="setRow(colorName, row.id, 'qty', $event.target.value)">
                  <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__ico gpl-cz__ico--sm gpl-cz__ico--danger" title="Remove player" @click="removeRow(colorName, row.id)"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18"/></svg></button>
                </div>
              </template>
              <div class="gpl-cz__roster-actions">
                <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__btn gpl-cz__btn--tool" @click="addRow(colorName)">+ Add player</button>
                <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__link" @click="pasteOpen = pasteOpen === colorName ? '' : colorName">Paste a list</button>
              </div>
              <div class="gpl-cz__paste" x-data="{ txt: '' }" x-show="pasteOpen === colorName" x-cloak>
                <textarea rows="4" x-model="txt" placeholder="One player per line, e.g.&#10;Smith, 23, L&#10;Jones 7 XL x2"></textarea>
                <div class="gpl-cz__roster-actions">
                  <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__btn gpl-cz__btn--tool" @click="importRoster(colorName, txt); txt = ''; pasteOpen = ''">Import players</button>
                  <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__link" @click="pasteOpen = ''">Cancel</button>
                </div>
              </div>
              <p class="gpl-cz__muted gpl-cz__roster-sum" x-text="rosterSummary(colorName)"></p>
            </div>
            <div class="gpl-cz__card-areas">
              <template x-for="area in areas" :key="area.name">
                <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__card-area" :class="{'is-done': designHasObjects(colorName, area.name), 'is-active': activeColor === colorName && activePrintArea === area.name}"
                  @click="activeColor = colorName; previewColorName = null; setArea(area.name)">
                  <span x-text="area.name"></span>
                  <svg x-show="designHasObjects(colorName, area.name)" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m5 12 5 5L20 7"/></svg>
                </button>
              </template>
            </div>
            <p class="gpl-cz__card-warn" x-show="!hasArtworkFor(colorName)" x-cloak>No design yet — add artwork or text on the stage.</p>
            {%- if section.blocks.size > 0 -%}
              <div class="gpl-cz__seg">
                <template x-for="m in methods" :key="m.name">
                  <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__seg-btn" :class="{'is-active': methodFor(colorName) === m.name}" :title="m.description" @click="setMethod(colorName, m.name)" x-text="m.name"></button>
                </template>
              </div>
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>
        </template>

        <div class="gpl-cz__addcolor">
          <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__addcolor-btn" @click="showAddColor = !showAddColor; colorSearch = ''">
            <span>+ Add colour</span>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" :style="showAddColor ? 'transform:rotate(180deg)' : ''"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
          </button>
          <div class="gpl-cz__addcolor-list" x-show="showAddColor" x-cloak>
            <div class="gpl-cz__addcolor-tools">
              <input type="search" placeholder="Search colours…" x-model="colorSearch">
              <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__link" @click="addAllColors()">Select all</button>
            </div>
            <div class="gpl-cz__addcolor-items">
              <template x-for="c in filteredColors()" :key="c.name">
                <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__addcolor-item" @click="toggleColor(c.name); showAddColor = false; activeColor = c.name">
                  <span class="gpl-cz__addcolor-swatch" :style="swatchStyle(c.name)"></span>
                  <span x-text="c.name"></span>
                </button>
              </template>
            </div>
            <p class="gpl-cz__addcolor-empty" x-show="!filteredColors().length">No more colours</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        {%- if s.learn_more_link != blank -%}
          <p class="gpl-cz__learn">Not sure which printing technique to choose? <a href="{{ s.learn_more_link }}">Learn more</a></p>
        {%- endif -%}
        <label class="gpl-cz__notes-wrap">
          <span class="gpl-cz__label">Notes for our designers <em>(optional)</em></span>
          <textarea class="gpl-cz__notes" rows="2" maxlength="500"
            placeholder="Ex: Remove background and change the black text to white"
            x-model="designerNotes" @change="persist()"></textarea>
        </label>
      </div>

      {%- comment -%} ---- Layers ---- {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="gpl-cz__pane" x-show="panel === 'layers'" x-cloak>
        <div class="gpl-cz__pane-head">
          <strong x-text="activePrintArea"></strong>
          <span class="gpl-cz__muted" x-text="objectsInArea().length + (objectsInArea().length === 1 ? ' layer' : ' layers')"></span>
          <span class="gpl-cz__pill" x-text="methodFor(activeColor)"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="gpl-cz__hist">
          <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__ico" title="Undo (⌘Z)" :disabled="!canUndo()" @click="undo()"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 14 4 9l5-5"/><path d="M4 9h11a5 5 0 0 1 0 10h-2"/></svg></button>
          <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__ico" title="Redo (⇧⌘Z)" :disabled="!canRedo()" @click="redo()"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m15 14 5-5-5-5"/><path d="M20 9H9a5 5 0 0 0 0 10h2"/></svg></button>
          <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__link gpl-cz__link--danger" x-show="objectsInArea().length" @click="clearArea(activeColor, activePrintArea)">Delete all</button>
        </div>
        <div class="gpl-cz__addrow">
          <label class="gpl-cz__btn gpl-cz__btn--tool">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 16V4M7 9l5-5 5 5"/><path d="M4 20h16"/></svg>
            <span>Upload</span>
            <input type="file" accept=".png,.jpg,.jpeg,.svg,.webp,.pdf,.heic,.tif,.tiff,.eps,.ai" hidden
              @change="uploadArtwork(activeColor, activePrintArea, $event.target.files[0]); $event.target.value=''">
          </label>
          <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__btn gpl-cz__btn--tool" @click="addText()">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 7V4h14v3M9 20h6M12 4v16"/></svg>
            <span>Text</span>
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__btn gpl-cz__btn--tool" @click="addNumber()">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 9h16M4 15h16M10 3 8 21M16 3l-2 18"/></svg>
            <span>Number</span>
          </button>
          <span class="gpl-cz__uploading" x-show="uploadingCount > 0" x-cloak>
            <svg class="gpl-cz__spin" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M12 3a9 9 0 1 0 9 9"/></svg> Uploading…
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="gpl-cz__layers">
          <template x-if="isLabelArea(activePrintArea) && !objectsInArea().length">
            <div class="gpl-cz__guide gpl-cz__guide--mobile">
          <h3 class="gpl-cz__guide-title">Create a neck tag for your brand</h3>
          <div class="gpl-cz__guide-box">
            <div class="gpl-cz__guide-tag">
              <span class="gpl-cz__guide-brand">YOUR BRAND</span>
              <span class="gpl-cz__guide-size">M</span>
              <span class="gpl-cz__guide-made">Made in Canada</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p>The outer square is the full <b>3 × 3 in</b> print area. For PNG files use a transparent <b>900 × 900 px</b> canvas at 300 DPI; for SVG a 3 × 3 in artboard. Leave unused space transparent.</p>
          <div class="gpl-cz__guide-actions">
            <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__btn gpl-cz__btn--tool" @click="addLabelTemplate()">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 7V4h14v3M9 20h6M12 4v16"/></svg>
              <span>Start from template</span>
            </button>
            <a class="gpl-cz__link" href="{{ 'gpl-neck-tag-template.svg' | asset_url }}" download="gta-neck-tag-template.svg">Download template (SVG)</a>
          </div>
          <ul class="gpl-cz__guide-list">
            <li>Include size, fibre content, country of origin, care instructions and your business identity — required for apparel sold in Canada.</li>
            <li>Make one label per size (a separate artwork file for each) so the printed size is right on every shirt.</li>
            <li>Pick text and logo colours that contrast with the garment so the tag stays legible.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
          </template>
          <p class="gpl-cz__empty" x-show="!isLabelArea(activePrintArea) && !objectsInArea().length">No layers on <span x-text="activePrintArea"></span> yet. Upload artwork or add text to start.</p>
          <template x-for="o in objectsInArea().slice().reverse()" :key="o.id">
            <div class="gpl-cz__layer" :class="{'is-active': sel.id === o.id, 'is-locked': o.locked}">
              <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__layer-main" @click="selectById(o.id)">
                <span class="gpl-cz__layer-type" x-text="o.type === 'image' ? 'IMG' : 'TXT'"></span>
                <span class="gpl-cz__layer-name" x-text="layerLabel(o)"></span>
                <span class="gpl-cz__layer-role" x-show="o.role" x-text="roleLabel(o)"></span>
              </button>
              <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__ico gpl-cz__ico--sm" title="Move up" @click="moveLayer(o.id, 'up')"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m6 14 6-6 6 6"/></svg></button>
              <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__ico gpl-cz__ico--sm" title="Move down" @click="moveLayer(o.id, 'down')"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m6 10 6 6 6-6"/></svg></button>
              <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__ico gpl-cz__ico--sm" :title="o.locked ? 'Unlock' : 'Lock'" @click="toggleLock(o.id)">
                <svg x-show="!o.locked" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="5" y="11" width="14" height="10" rx="2"/><path d="M8 11V7a4 4 0 0 1 7.5-2"/></svg>
                <svg x-show="o.locked" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="5" y="11" width="14" height="10" rx="2"/><path d="M8 11V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v4"/></svg>
              </button>
              <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__ico gpl-cz__ico--sm gpl-cz__ico--danger" title="Delete" @click="removeById(o.id)"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M4 7h16M9 7V5h6v2M6 7l1 13h10l1-13M10 11v6M14 11v6"/></svg></button>
            </div>
          </template>
        </div>
        <div class="gpl-cz__areasum">
          <p class="gpl-cz__label">Print areas — <span x-text="activeColor"></span></p>
          <template x-for="area in areas" :key="area.name">
            <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__areasum-row" :class="{'is-active': activePrintArea === area.name}" @click="setArea(area.name)">
              <span x-text="area.name"></span>
              <em x-text="zoneLabel(area.name)"></em>
              <strong x-text="designCount(activeColor, area.name) ? designCount(activeColor, area.name) + ' layer' + (designCount(activeColor, area.name) === 1 ? '' : 's') : '—'"></strong>
            </button>
          </template>
        </div>
      </div>

      {%- comment -%} ---- Files ---- {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="gpl-cz__pane" x-show="panel === 'files'" x-cloak>
        <label class="gpl-cz__drop">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 16V6M7 11l5-5 5 5"/><path d="M4 20h16"/></svg>
          <strong>Upload artwork to <span x-text="activePrintArea"></span></strong>
          <span>PNG, JPG, SVG, PDF, EPS, AI, HEIC, TIFF or WEBP · max 50 MB</span>
          <input type="file" accept=".png,.jpg,.jpeg,.svg,.webp,.pdf,.heic,.tif,.tiff,.eps,.ai" hidden
            @change="uploadArtwork(activeColor, activePrintArea, $event.target.files[0]); $event.target.value=''">
        </label>
        <p class="gpl-cz__fine">Originals are kept at full resolution for print. By uploading you confirm you have the right to use this artwork.</p>
        <p class="gpl-cz__label">Your library <span class="gpl-cz__muted" x-text="library.length ? '(' + library.length + ')' : ''"></span></p>
        <p class="gpl-cz__empty" x-show="!library.length">Files you upload appear here so you can reuse them on other sides and colours.</p>
        <div class="gpl-cz__lib">
          <template x-for="item in library" :key="item.url">
            <div class="gpl-cz__lib-item">
              <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__lib-thumb" :title="'Add to ' + activePrintArea" @click="useLibrary(item)">
                <img :src="thumbFor(item)" width="120" height="120" alt="" loading="lazy">
              </button>
              <span class="gpl-cz__lib-name" x-text="item.filename"></span>
              <div class="gpl-cz__lib-actions">
                <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__link" @click="useLibrary(item)">Use</button>
                <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__link gpl-cz__link--danger" @click="removeFromLibrary(item.url)">Remove</button>
              </div>
            </div>
          </template>
        </div>
      </div>

      {%- comment -%} ---- Text ---- {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="gpl-cz__pane" x-show="panel === 'text'" x-cloak>
        <div class="gpl-cz__addrow gpl-cz__addrow--stack">
          <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__btn gpl-cz__btn--tool" @click="addText()">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 7V4h14v3M9 20h6M12 4v16"/></svg>
            <span>Add text</span>
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__btn gpl-cz__btn--tool" @click="addNumber()">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 9h16M4 15h16M10 3 8 21M16 3l-2 18"/></svg>
            <span>Add number</span>
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__btn gpl-cz__btn--tool" @click="addNameNumber()">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 6h16M4 12h8"/><path d="M14 20l3-8 3 8M15.2 17h3.6"/></svg>
            <span>Name + number</span>
          </button>
        </div>
        <p class="gpl-cz__label">Font styles</p>
        <template x-for="g in fontGroups" :key="g">
          <div class="gpl-cz__fontgroup">
            <p class="gpl-cz__muted" x-text="g"></p>
            <div class="gpl-cz__fonts">
              <template x-for="f in fontsIn(g)" :key="f.name">
                <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__font" :style="'font-family:\'' + f.name + '\';font-weight:' + f.weights[0]" :title="f.name"
                  @click="sel.has && sel.type === 'text' ? (sel.fontFamily = f.name, sel.fontWeight = f.weights[0], applySel()) : addText({ fontFamily: f.name, fontWeight: f.weights[0] })">
                  <span x-text="f.name"></span>
                </button>
              </template>
            </div>
          </div>
        </template>
        <p class="gpl-cz__fine">Tip: with text selected, clicking a font applies it. Otherwise it adds new text in that font.</p>
      </div>
    </aside>

    {%- comment -%} ============ PROPERTIES ============ {%- endcomment -%}
    <aside class="gpl-cz__props">
      <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__sheet-close" @click="sheet = false" aria-label="Close panel"><span></span></button>
      <div class="gpl-cz__props-empty" x-show="!sel.has">
        <template x-if="isLabelArea(activePrintArea)">
        <div class="gpl-cz__guide">
          <h3 class="gpl-cz__guide-title">Create a neck tag for your brand</h3>
          <div class="gpl-cz__guide-box">
            <div class="gpl-cz__guide-tag">
              <span class="gpl-cz__guide-brand">YOUR BRAND</span>
              <span class="gpl-cz__guide-size">M</span>
              <span class="gpl-cz__guide-made">Made in Canada</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p>The outer square is the full <b>3 × 3 in</b> print area. For PNG files use a transparent <b>900 × 900 px</b> canvas at 300 DPI; for SVG a 3 × 3 in artboard. Leave unused space transparent.</p>
          <div class="gpl-cz__guide-actions">
            <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__btn gpl-cz__btn--tool" @click="addLabelTemplate()">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 7V4h14v3M9 20h6M12 4v16"/></svg>
              <span>Start from template</span>
            </button>
            <a class="gpl-cz__link" href="{{ 'gpl-neck-tag-template.svg' | asset_url }}" download="gta-neck-tag-template.svg">Download template (SVG)</a>
          </div>
          <ul class="gpl-cz__guide-list">
            <li>Include size, fibre content, country of origin, care instructions and your business identity — required for apparel sold in Canada.</li>
            <li>Make one label per size (a separate artwork file for each) so the printed size is right on every shirt.</li>
            <li>Pick text and logo colours that contrast with the garment so the tag stays legible.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        </template>
        <template x-if="!isLabelArea(activePrintArea)">
        <div class="gpl-cz__props-empty-inner">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m4 4 7 16 2-7 7-2L4 4Z"/></svg>
        <strong>Choose a layer to edit</strong>
        <span>Click artwork or text on the stage. Drag to move, corners to resize, the top handle to rotate.</span>
        <dl class="gpl-cz__props-facts">
          <dt>Print area</dt><dd><span x-text="activePrintArea"></span> · <span x-text="zoneLabel(activePrintArea)"></span></dd>
          <dt>Method</dt><dd x-text="methodFor(activeColor)"></dd>
          <dt>Shortcuts</dt><dd>Arrows nudge · ⌘Z undo · ⌘D duplicate · Delete removes</dd>
        </dl>
        </div>
        </template>
      </div>

      <div class="gpl-cz__props-body" x-show="sel.has" x-cloak>
        <div class="gpl-cz__group" x-show="placementsFor(activePrintArea).length">
          <p class="gpl-cz__group-title">Smart placements</p>
          <div class="gpl-cz__placements">
            <template x-for="p in placementsFor(activePrintArea)" :key="p.id">
              <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__placement" :class="{'is-active': sel.placement === p.id}" @click="applyPlacement(p.id)">
                <i :class="'gpl-cz__placement-ico gpl-cz__placement-ico--' + p.id"></i>
                <strong x-text="p.name"></strong>
                <span x-text="p.desc"></span>
              </button>
            </template>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="gpl-cz__group">
          <p class="gpl-cz__group-title">Transforms <em x-text="sel.locked ? '· locked' : ''"></em></p>
          <div class="gpl-cz__row4">
            <label class="gpl-cz__num"><span>X</span><input type="number" step="0.05" :value="sel.xIn" :disabled="sel.locked" @change="setPosIn('x', $event.target.value)"><b>in</b></label>
            <label class="gpl-cz__num"><span>Y</span><input type="number" step="0.05" :value="sel.yIn" :disabled="sel.locked" @change="setPosIn('y', $event.target.value)"><b>in</b></label>
            <label class="gpl-cz__num"><span>W</span><input type="number" step="0.05" min="0.1" :value="sel.wIn" :disabled="sel.locked" @change="setDimIn('w', $event.target.value)"><b>in</b></label>
            <label class="gpl-cz__num"><span>H</span><input type="number" step="0.05" min="0.1" :value="sel.hIn" :disabled="sel.locked" @change="setDimIn('h', $event.target.value)"><b>in</b></label>
          </div>
          <div class="gpl-cz__row4 gpl-cz__row4--rot">
            <label class="gpl-cz__num gpl-cz__num--wide"><span>Rotate</span><input type="number" step="1" :value="sel.angle" :disabled="sel.locked" @change="setAngle($event.target.value)"><b>°</b></label>
            <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__ico" title="Reset rotation" :disabled="sel.locked" @click="setAngle(0)"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 3-6.7"/><path d="M3 4v5h5"/></svg></button>
            <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__ico" title="Flip horizontal" :class="{'is-active': sel.flipX}" :disabled="sel.locked" @click="flip('x')"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3v18"/><path d="M8 7 3 12l5 5"/><path d="m16 7 5 5-5 5"/></svg></button>
            <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__ico" title="Flip vertical" :class="{'is-active': sel.flipY}" :disabled="sel.locked" @click="flip('y')"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 12h18"/><path d="m7 8 5-5 5 5"/><path d="m7 16 5 5 5-5"/></svg></button>
          </div>
          <p class="gpl-cz__label">Align to print area</p>
          <div class="gpl-cz__row6">
            <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__ico" title="Align left" :disabled="sel.locked" @click="align('left')"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M4 3v18"/><rect x="7" y="7" width="12" height="4" rx="1"/><rect x="7" y="13" width="8" height="4" rx="1"/></svg></button>
            <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__ico" title="Center horizontally" :disabled="sel.locked" @click="align('hcenter')"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M12 3v18"/><rect x="5" y="7" width="14" height="4" rx="1"/><rect x="8" y="13" width="8" height="4" rx="1"/></svg></button>
            <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__ico" title="Align right" :disabled="sel.locked" @click="align('right')"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M20 3v18"/><rect x="5" y="7" width="12" height="4" rx="1"/><rect x="9" y="13" width="8" height="4" rx="1"/></svg></button>
            <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__ico" title="Align top" :disabled="sel.locked" @click="align('top')"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M3 4h18"/><rect x="7" y="7" width="4" height="12" rx="1"/><rect x="13" y="7" width="4" height="8" rx="1"/></svg></button>
            <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__ico" title="Center vertically" :disabled="sel.locked" @click="align('vcenter')"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M3 12h18"/><rect x="7" y="5" width="4" height="14" rx="1"/><rect x="13" y="8" width="4" height="8" rx="1"/></svg></button>
            <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__ico" title="Align bottom" :disabled="sel.locked" @click="align('bottom')"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M3 20h18"/><rect x="7" y="5" width="4" height="12" rx="1"/><rect x="13" y="9" width="4" height="8" rx="1"/></svg></button>
          </div>
          <p class="gpl-cz__label">Arrange</p>
          <div class="gpl-cz__row6">
            <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__ico" title="Bring forward" @click="arrange('forward')"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="9" y="4" width="11" height="11" rx="1"/><path d="M4 9v11h11"/></svg></button>
            <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__ico" title="Send backward" @click="arrange('backward')"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="4" y="9" width="11" height="11" rx="1"/><path d="M9 4h11v11"/></svg></button>
            <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__ico" title="Bring to front" @click="arrange('front')"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m6 14 6-6 6 6"/><path d="M6 20h12"/></svg></button>
            <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__ico" title="Send to back" @click="arrange('back')"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m6 10 6 6 6-6"/><path d="M6 4h12"/></svg></button>
            <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__ico" title="Duplicate (⌘D)" @click="duplicateSelected()"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="9" y="9" width="11" height="11" rx="2"/><path d="M15 5H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v9"/></svg></button>
            <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__ico" :title="sel.locked ? 'Unlock' : 'Lock'" :class="{'is-active': sel.locked}" @click="toggleLock()"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="5" y="11" width="14" height="10" rx="2"/><path d="M8 11V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v4"/></svg></button>
          </div>
          <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__btn gpl-cz__btn--ghost gpl-cz__btn--danger gpl-cz__btn--block" @click="deleteSelected()">Delete layer</button>
        </div>

        <template x-if="sel.type === 'text'">
          <div class="gpl-cz__group">
            <p class="gpl-cz__group-title">Text styling</p>
            <label class="gpl-cz__field gpl-cz__field--wide">
              <span>Text</span>
              <textarea rows="2" maxlength="120" x-model="sel.text" @input="applySel()"></textarea>
            </label>
            <label class="gpl-cz__field gpl-cz__field--wide">
              <span>Font</span>
              <select x-model="sel.fontFamily" @change="applySel()" :style="'font-family:\'' + sel.fontFamily + '\''">
                <template x-for="g in fontGroups" :key="g">
                  <optgroup :label="g">
                    <template x-for="f in fontsIn(g)" :key="f.name">
                      <option :value="f.name" x-text="f.name" :style="'font-family:\'' + f.name + '\''"></option>
                    </template>
                  </optgroup>
                </template>
              </select>
            </label>
            <div class="gpl-cz__row3">
              <label class="gpl-cz__field">
                <span>Size</span>
                <input type="number" min="20" max="900" step="5" x-model.number="sel.fontSize" @change="applySel()">
              </label>
              <label class="gpl-cz__field" x-show="fontMeta(sel.fontFamily).weights.length > 1">
                <span>Weight</span>
                <select x-model="sel.fontWeight" @change="applySel()">
                  <template x-for="w in fontMeta(sel.fontFamily).weights" :key="w">
                    <option :value="w" x-text="w === '400' ? 'Normal' : (w === '700' ? 'Bold' : 'Extra bold')"></option>
                  </template>
                </select>
              </label>
              <label class="gpl-cz__field" x-show="fontMeta(sel.fontFamily).italic">
                <span>Style</span>
                <select x-model="sel.fontStyle" @change="applySel()">
                  <option value="normal">Normal</option>
                  <option value="italic">Italic</option>
                </select>
              </label>
              <label class="gpl-cz__field">
                <span>Align</span>
                <select x-model="sel.textAlign" @change="applySel()">
                  <option value="left">Left</option>
                  <option value="center">Center</option>
                  <option value="right">Right</option>
                </select>
              </label>
            </div>
            <label class="gpl-cz__field">
              <span>Font size <em x-text="sel.fontSize"></em></span>
              <input type="range" min="20" max="900" step="5" x-model.number="sel.fontSize" @input="applySel()">
            </label>
            <label class="gpl-cz__field gpl-cz__field--wide">
              <span>Team field <em>replaced per player on team orders</em></span>
              <select x-model="sel.role" @change="applySel()">
                <option value="">None — fixed text</option>
                <option value="name">Player name</option>
                <option value="number">Player number</option>
              </select>
            </label>
            <div class="gpl-cz__row2">
              <label class="gpl-cz__field">
                <span>Line height</span>
                <input type="number" min="0.6" max="3" step="0.05" x-model.number="sel.lineHeight" @change="applySel()">
              </label>
              <label class="gpl-cz__field">
                <span>Letter spacing <em x-text="sel.charSpacing"></em></span>
                <input type="range" min="-100" max="600" step="10" x-model.number="sel.charSpacing" @input="applySel()">
              </label>
            </div>
            <div class="gpl-cz__row3">
              <label class="gpl-cz__field gpl-cz__field--color">
                <span>Text colour</span>
                <input type="color" x-model="sel.fill" @input="applySel()">
              </label>
              <label class="gpl-cz__field gpl-cz__field--color">
                <span>Outline</span>
                <input type="color" x-model="sel.stroke" @input="applySel()">
              </label>
              <label class="gpl-cz__field">
                <span>Outline width <em x-text="sel.strokeWidth"></em></span>
                <input type="range" min="0" max="40" step="1" x-model.number="sel.strokeWidth" @input="applySel()">
              </label>
            </div>
            <p class="gpl-cz__label">Warp effect</p>
            <div class="gpl-cz__row2">
              <label class="gpl-cz__field">
                <span>Effect</span>
                <select x-model="sel.warp" @change="applySel()">
                  <template x-for="w in warps" :key="w.id">
                    <option :value="w.id" x-text="w.name"></option>
                  </template>
                </select>
              </label>
              <label class="gpl-cz__field" x-show="sel.warp !== 'none'">
                <span>Intensity <em x-text="sel.warpAmt + '%'"></em></span>
                <input type="range" min="5" max="100" step="5" x-model.number="sel.warpAmt" @input="applySel()">
              </label>
            </div>
          </div>
        </template>
      </div>
    </aside>

  {%- comment -%} ============ BOTTOM BAR ============ {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="gpl-cz__bar">
    <div class="gpl-cz__bar-sum">
      <strong x-text="money(totalPrice())"></strong>
      <span x-text="totalUnits() + ' piece' + (totalUnits() === 1 ? '' : 's') + (areasUsed() > 0 ? ' · ' + areasUsed() + ' print area' + (areasUsed() === 1 ? '' : 's') : '')"></span>
      <span class="gpl-cz__bar-ship">Order today, ships by <b x-text="deliveryRange()"></b></span>
    </div>
    <p class="gpl-cz__bar-gate" x-show="!canSubmit() && !submitting" x-text="gateMessage()"></p>
    <p class="gpl-cz__error" x-show="errorMsg" x-text="errorMsg"></p>
    <button type="button" class="gpl-cz__submit" :disabled="!canSubmit()" @click="addToCart()">
      <span x-show="!submitting">Add to Cart</span>
      <span x-show="submitting" x-text="progressMsg || 'Preparing print files…'"></span>
    </button>
    {%- if s.upload_public_key == blank -%}
      <p class="gpl-cz__admin-warn">⚠ Admin: set the Uploadcare public key in the customizer section settings — uploads are disabled until then.</p>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
   </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% style %}
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} {
    --cz-red: {{ s.color_accent | default: '#D71920' }};
    --cz-line: #E4E4E4;
    --cz-bg: #F5F5F5;
    background: #FFFFFF;
    color: #111111;
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} [x-cloak] { display: none !important; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} button { font-family: inherit; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__ws {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 68px 340px minmax(0, 1fr) 300px;
    grid-template-rows: minmax(720px, auto) auto;
    grid-template-areas: "rail panel canvas props" "bar bar bar bar";
    border-top: 1px solid var(--cz-line);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--cz-line);
  }

  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__dock { display: contents; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__sheet-close { display: none; }

  /* ---- rail ---- */
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__rail { grid-area: rail; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; padding: 8px 6px; border-right: 1px solid var(--cz-line); background: #FAFAFA; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__rail-btn {
    position: relative; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 5px; width: 100%;
    padding: 10px 2px; border: 1px solid transparent; border-radius: 8px; background: none; color: #555; cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.01em;
  }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__rail-btn svg { width: 22px; height: 22px; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__rail-btn:hover { color: #111; background: #F0F0F0; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__rail-btn.is-active { color: #111; background: #FFFFFF; border-color: var(--cz-line); box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__rail-badge { position: absolute; top: 6px; right: 8px; min-width: 16px; height: 16px; padding: 0 4px; border-radius: 8px; background: var(--cz-red); color: #FFF; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px; line-height: 16px; text-align: center; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__rail-btn--edit { display: none; }

  /* ---- panel ---- */
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__panel { grid-area: panel; border-right: 1px solid var(--cz-line); overflow-y: auto; max-height: 860px; background: #FFFFFF; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__pane { padding: 16px 16px 24px; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__pane-head { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 14px; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__pane-head strong { font-size: 15px; text-transform: uppercase; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__muted { color: #777; font-size: 12px; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__pill { margin-left: auto; padding: 3px 9px; border-radius: 999px; background: rgba(215,25,32,0.08); color: var(--cz-red); font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__label { margin: 14px 0 6px; font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.04em; color: #555; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__label em { font-style: normal; font-weight: 500; text-transform: none; color: #999; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__fine { margin: 8px 0 0; color: #777; font-size: 11.5px; line-height: 1.5; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__empty { margin: 6px 0; padding: 12px; border: 1px dashed #D5D5D5; border-radius: 6px; color: #777; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__link { border: none; background: none; padding: 4px 6px; color: #111; font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; cursor: pointer; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__link--danger { color: var(--cz-red); }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__ico {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 34px; height: 34px; flex: 0 0 auto;
    border: 1px solid var(--cz-line); border-radius: 6px; background: #FFFFFF; color: #333; cursor: pointer; padding: 0;
  }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__ico svg { width: 17px; height: 17px; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__ico:hover:not(:disabled) { border-color: #111; color: #111; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__ico.is-active { border-color: var(--cz-red); color: var(--cz-red); background: rgba(215,25,32,0.06); }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__ico:disabled { opacity: 0.35; cursor: default; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__ico--sm { width: 28px; height: 28px; border-color: transparent; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__ico--sm svg { width: 15px; height: 15px; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__ico--danger:hover:not(:disabled) { color: var(--cz-red); border-color: var(--cz-red); }

  /* product pane */
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__product { display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: center; padding-bottom: 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--cz-line); }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__product-thumb { width: 56px; height: 56px; object-fit: contain; border-radius: 6px; background: var(--cz-bg); flex: 0 0 auto; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__title { margin: 0; font-family: var(--gpl-font-heading, inherit); font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; line-height: 1.05; font-size: 15px; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__subtitle { margin: 3px 0 0; color: #666; font-size: 11.5px; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__card { margin-top: 12px; border: 1px solid var(--cz-line); border-radius: 8px; background: #FFFFFF; padding: 10px 12px 12px; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__card.is-active { border-color: #111; box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px #111; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__card-head { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; width: 100%; background: none; border: none; padding: 0 0 8px; cursor: pointer; color: #111; text-align: left; font-size: 13px; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__card-head em { font-style: normal; color: #777; font-size: 11.5px; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__grid-thumb { width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 50%; border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.2); background-color: #DDD; background-size: cover; background-position: center; flex: 0 0 auto; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__card-remove { margin-left: auto; display: flex; color: #999; padding: 4px; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__card-remove svg { width: 14px; height: 14px; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__card-remove:hover { color: var(--cz-red); }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__sizes { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 6px; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__size { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 3px; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__size input { width: 100%; padding: 8px 4px; text-align: center; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #CFCFCF; border-radius: 5px; color: #111; font: inherit; font-size: 13px; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__size input:focus { outline: none; border-color: var(--cz-red); }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__oos { width: 100%; text-align: center; color: var(--cz-red); font-size: 9px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 10px 0; border: 1px dashed #E0E0E0; border-radius: 5px; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__size-label { font-weight: 800; font-size: 10.5px; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__size-price { color: #888; font-size: 10.5px; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__card-areas { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 5px; margin-top: 10px; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__card-area { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; padding: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid var(--cz-line); border-radius: 999px; background: #FAFAFA; color: #666; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__card-area svg { width: 12px; height: 12px; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__card-area.is-done { color: #1E7A45; border-color: #BFE3CC; background: #EEF9F2; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__card-area.is-active { box-shadow: 0 0 0 1.5px #111; color: #111; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__card-warn { margin: 8px 0 0; color: #9A6B00; font-size: 11.5px; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__seg { display: flex; margin-top: 10px; border: 1px solid var(--cz-line); border-radius: 6px; overflow: hidden; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__seg-btn { flex: 1; padding: 7px 4px; border: none; border-right: 1px solid var(--cz-line); background: #FFFFFF; color: #555; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; cursor: pointer; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__seg-btn:last-child { border-right: none; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__seg-btn.is-active { background: #111; color: #FFF; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__addcolor { position: relative; margin-top: 12px; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__addcolor-btn {
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 8px; width: 100%;
    cursor: pointer; padding: 11px; border: 1px dashed #B5B5B5; border-radius: 6px;
    background: #FFFFFF; color: #111; font: inherit; font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 12px;
  }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__addcolor-btn:hover { border-color: #111; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__addcolor-btn svg { width: 14px; height: 14px; transition: transform 0.15s ease; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__addcolor-list { margin-top: 6px; border: 1px solid var(--cz-line); border-radius: 6px; background: #FFFFFF; padding: 8px; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__addcolor-tools { display: flex; gap: 6px; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__addcolor-tools input { flex: 1; min-width: 0; padding: 8px 10px; border: 1px solid #CFCFCF; border-radius: 5px; font: inherit; font-size: 12.5px; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__addcolor-items { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; max-height: 220px; overflow-y: auto; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__addcolor-item { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; cursor: pointer; padding: 5px 10px 5px 5px; border: 1px solid var(--cz-line); border-radius: 20px; background: #FAFAFA; color: #111; font: inherit; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__addcolor-item:hover { border-color: var(--cz-red); }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__addcolor-swatch { width: 18px; height: 18px; border-radius: 50%; border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.2); background-color: #DDD; background-size: cover; flex: 0 0 auto; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__addcolor-empty { margin: 4px 6px; color: #888; font-size: 12px; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__learn { margin: 14px 0 0; color: #555; font-size: 12px; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__learn a { color: inherit; font-weight: 700; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__notes-wrap { display: block; margin-top: 4px; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__notes { width: 100%; padding: 9px 11px; border: 1px solid #CFCFCF; border-radius: 5px; font: inherit; font-size: 12.5px; color: #333; resize: vertical; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__notes:focus { outline: none; border-color: #111; }

  /* layers pane */
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__hist { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__hist .gpl-cz__link { margin-left: auto; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__addrow { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; align-items: center; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__addrow--stack { flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__addrow--stack .gpl-cz__btn { justify-content: center; padding: 12px; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__btn {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; cursor: pointer;
    padding: 9px 12px; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 11px;
    border: 1px solid #B5B5B5; color: #111; background: transparent; font-family: inherit;
  }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__btn--tool { border-color: #111; }
  #gpl-cz-{{ section.id }} .gpl-cz__btn--tool:hover { background: #111; color: #FFF; }
